  "correct": "1",
  "solution": "According to the BODMAS rule:\n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/2042326d26ec7b593e52bbbdd22d890b59b1e59f92be81a7235509e9af1c4625.png] \n\n**Option 1 :)** ÷, + and 5, 10\n\n**Given:**\n\n**630 + 6 - 5 ÷ 40 × 10 = 295**\n\n**After interchanging signs and numbers;**\n\n***__630 __******__÷__******__ 6__***** - 10 + 40 × 5 = 295**\n\n**By BODMAS rule**\n\n**105 - 10 + *__40 × 5__* = 295**\n\n***__105__***** - 10 + *__200__* = 295**\n\n***__305 – 10__***** = 295**\n\n**295 = 295** **(LHS = RHS)**\n\n**Option 2 :)** ÷, - and 10, 6\n\nGiven:\n\n630 + 6 - 5 ÷ 40 × 10 = 295\n\nAfter interchanging signs and numbers;\n\n630 + ***__10 __******__÷__******__ 5__*** - 40 × 6 = 295\n\nBy BODMAS rule\n\n630 + 2 – ***__40 × 6__*** = 295\n\n***__630 + 2__*** – 240 = 295\n\n632 – 240 = 295\n\n392 = 295 **(LHS ≠ RHS)**\n\n**Option 3:) **÷, × and 5, 6\n\nGiven:\n\n630 + 6 - 5 ÷ 40 × 10 = 295\n\nAfter interchanging signs and numbers;\n\n630 + 5 - 6 × ***__40 __******__÷__******__ 10__*** = 295\n\nBy BODMAS rule\n\n630 + 5 - ***__6 × 4__*** = 295\n\n***__630 + 5__*** - 24 = 295\n\n***__635 – 24__*** = 295\n\n611 = 295** (LHS ≠ RHS)**\n\n**Option 4:) **+. - and 6, 5\n\nGiven:\n\n630 + 6 - 5 ÷ 40 × 10 = 295\n\nAfter interchanging signs and numbers;\n\n630 - 5 + ***__6 ÷ 40__*** × 10 = 295\n\nBy BODMAS rule\n\n630 - 5 + ***__0.15 × 10__*** = 295\n\n***__630__*** – 5 ***__+ 1.5__*** = 295\n\n631.5 – 5 = 295\n\n626.5 = 295 **(LHS ≠ RHS)**\n\nHence, the correct answer is **“****÷, + and 5, 10****”.**",
